        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 2:21PM EDT until September 25 at 8:00AM EDT by NWS Gray ME</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...For the first Small Craft Advisory, seas 2 to 5 ft
expected. For the second Small Craft Advisory, northeast winds
20 to 25 kt with gusts up to around 30 kt and seas 4 to 7 ft
expected.

* WHERE...Casco Bay.

* WHEN...For the first Small Craft Advisory, from 8 PM this
evening to 8 AM EDT Friday. For the second Small Craft
Advisory, from 2 AM Saturday to 8 PM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
